# A field store through the raw heap pointer into the bytes the fresh
# token holds the permission to; the token records the store.
mark_bound	raw pointer (internal)	RefinedRust
# As `mark_bound`, for `rehome`, which the token does not record.
mark_rehome	raw pointer (internal)	RefinedRust
# Ghost only: returns the permission to the heap's whole block (the head,
# which creation passed on in its `FreshHeap`, joined with the home
# headers' permissions it uses up) and the block's `MetaClaim`, which
# `init_fields` dropped: Verus ghost state RefinedRust cannot produce.
# A Verus proof would keep the head and the claim in the heap's ghost
# state; it rests on `tcaches::heap_at`'s one-reference contract.
axiom_heap_block	allocator invariant	Verus
